 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Slow call triggers workflow task heartbeats\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 3  \u00b7  **Symptom:** History shows extra workflow task completions mid-call; queries wait ~8 s.  \u00b7  **Cause:** A call passed 80% of the workflow task timeout (8 s of 10 s).  \u00b7  **Fix:** Shorten the call or move it to a regular activity.\n\n**What to watch:** Workflow task heartbeats per workflow and query latency for the risk-check flow; both drop when risk runs as a regular activity.\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | broken | 10 s risk check as a local activity | 120 s | Risk vendor p50 9 s. The SDK heartbeats the workflow task at 8 s (WORKFLOW_TASK_HEARTBEAT_COEFFICIENT = 4/5). |\n| 2 | baseline | recover | 30 s |  |\n| 3 | fixed | risk check as a regular activity | 120 s | The workflow task completes right after scheduling the activity; queries are answered immediately. |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Phase",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "demo_scenario_variant{scenario=\"wft-heartbeat\"}",
     "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#8E8E8E",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "idle",
         "color": "#8E8E8E",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "baseline",
         "color": "#3274D9",
         "index": 1
        },
        "2": {
         "text": "broken",
         "color": "#E02F44",
         "index": 2
        },
        "3": {
         "text": "fixed",
         "color": "#56A64B",
         "index": 3
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "custom": {
      "fillOpacity": 80,
      "lineWidth": 0
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "showValue": "auto",
    "mergeValues": true,
    "rowHeight": 0.8,
    "alignValue": "left",
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": false
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "single"
    }
   },
   "id": 2,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 7,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Query latency (status query 300 ms after start)",
   "description": "Queries (like signals and updates) wait while a workflow task is open on a worker.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, policy) (rate(demo_query_latency_seconds_bucket{policy=~\"heartbeat_.*\"}[30s])))",
     "legendFormat": "p50 {{policy}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, policy) (rate(demo_query_latency_seconds_bucket{policy=~\"heartbeat_.*\"}[30s])))",
     "legendFormat": "p99 {{policy}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "B"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 8,
      "showPoints": "never",
      "spanNulls": true,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "none",
       "group": "A"
      },
      "axisSoftMin": 0,
      "lineInterpolation": "linear"
     },
     "color": {
      "mode": "palette-classic"
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom",
     "showLegend": true
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi",
     "sort": "desc"
    }
   },
   "id": 3,
